    <p class="content-note">These aren't apples-to-apples plans: Airhub's Spain price is data only, while ByteSIM's Spain plan bundles a huge data allowance with a working phone number that can call and text. Airhub is the cheaper way to get online with an SMS-capable extra number; ByteSIM is the more expensive way to get a number that actually functions like a phone number.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Discount Codes</h2>
